@@ -5,6 +5,13 @@
 
 ## 2026-08-11
 
+### 1947 — SSH bootstrap diagnostics separate security gates from transient operations (TASK-260715-13labb)
+- IMPLEMENTATION: The macOS profile-driven SSH boundary now projects typed profile, path, connect, negotiation, host-policy, Keychain, public-key authentication, cancellation/user-stop, and session-close causes into the fixed `sshProfileBootstrap` provider domain. Public errors and runtime snapshots carry only stable code/stage, configuration generation, user-action category, retry disposition, and reviewed algorithm/endpoint-family context; arbitrary underlying prose and identifying values are structurally unrepresentable.
+- RETRY POLICY: Corrupt or unsupported profiles, host mismatch/change/revocation/unsupported algorithms, inaccessible or malformed credentials, and authentication rejection are terminal until configuration, trust, or credential state changes. Only bounded timeouts, unavailable paths, and an explicit allowlist of transient transport interruptions are marked `retryableLater`; this task records classification and adds no reconnect behavior.
+- FINDING: Mapping solely by the current SSH phase can mislabel an authentication-stage timeout or connection loss as `authenticationRejected`. The mapper therefore gives cancellation, timeout, and transient transport interruption precedence over security-stage mapping, keeping operational failures distinct from trust/authentication rejection.
+- VERIFICATION: Golden taxonomy, hostile-text/prohibited-data, cancellation, NSError redaction, socket/URL, NWError, OSStatus, runtime-snapshot, selected libssh2 timeout, and live authentication-timeout tests pass. Recursive Swift format lint, boundary/native/libssh2 verification, all 425 Swift tests in 35 suites, `swift build`, and `git diff --check` exit 0.
+- BOARD ANOMALY: `task-board validate` exits 0 while reporting the pre-existing `STORY-260715-2wjwuf` stored-backlog versus child-development aggregate mismatch. The task evidence and checklist are valid; no out-of-scope direct parent rewrite was made.
+
 ### 1902 — Mandatory macOS host identity policy fails closed before credentials (TASK-260715-12zaq5)
 - IMPLEMENTATION: The selected libssh2 path now consumes one immutable snapshot-backed `SSHApprovedHostIdentityPolicy`. It accepts only an exact reviewed algorithm plus SHA-256 fingerprint tuple, validates the raw SSH wire key shape, binds the canonical host and port, checks revoked before approved records, and returns typed first-use, changed, revoked, unsupported, host-mismatch, or malformed outcomes before credential lookup.
 - PRIVACY AND ROTATION: Raw host-key bytes remain inside pre-auth policy input and no longer enter accepted session or credential values. First use returns bounded algorithm/fingerprint/canonical-host evidence for an explicit containing-app action; approved/revoked matches return only provenance and first/previous-last/observed timestamps. Printable evidence, decisions, inputs, and acceptance redact host, fingerprint, timestamps, and raw bytes.
